content = " Oh, this was today? Sorry for not remembering. 
 
 I pushed updates 5.32, 5.33, and 5.34 yesterday to the firewall. 
 
 As for your wellbeing question, part of a company-wide wellbeing checkup, I live at 44th Whiteplane Lane with my husband and daughter. Our living situation is somewhat good, but we had to invest in the security of our gated community. 
 
 Sensitive information to ask about, but I suppose it was part of the work contract and our cybersecurity is top-notch so I don’t mind. 
 
 -Ellie."
